<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Iolcos Pioneer - 110,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Constanza $7.30 fio 30,000 shinc/15,000 shex 20-30/3 AMCI.</p>
<p>Maritime Queen - 66,000 tonnes coal Tanjung Bara/Dahanu, WC India $9.25 fio 30,000 shinc/40,000 shex 18-25/3 Indian Government.</p>
<p>TBN - 60,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Vado $8.25 fio 35,000 shinc/10,000 shinc 24-31/3 Premuda.</p>
<p>ORE - Regina - 100,000 tonnes ore Saldanha/Qingdao $11.15 fio scale load/10,000 shex 5/4 cancelling (on subs).</p>
</text>
